World Emperor             Bradipo I        5    10   None
Esteemed High Chancellor  Indra            1   106   Adele           23    33
  An eerily insubstantial Crystal Ball suddenly appeared in Indra's hands, 
and a soft voice that only Indra could hear whispered "This is the Crystal 
Ball of the Chancellors of the Ancient Dynasty, which governed this world 
many centuries ago.  It will serve you for as long as you merit the title of 
Esteemed High Chancellor, and can not be transferred.  With this Crystal 
Ball, you may conjure visions of the adventures of any character in this 
world.  To use this magic power, just cast a Clairvoyance spell, which will 
automatically be successful even if you have no skill in magic.  Using the 
Crystal Ball will not use up a Psychic Magic spell".  It will also list all 
offices and titles held by the kingdom of the spied-upon character.

