GENERAL INTELLIGENCE REPORT

Kingdom of Babba Sissoko (#0):
  In fall, Rainulf (#25) moved into Abu Matariq.
  In early winter, Rainulf rode into Macondo.
  In early winter, Thrym (#59) travelled to Kiska.
  In spring, Tlazolteotl (#88) flew into Shasta.
  Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0)'s minions initiated a campaign of 
conquest directed at Shasta, a Mountain province owing allegiance to 
Prometeo (#5).  Tlazolteotl (#88) was in command of the attacking armies.  
The defending forces were commanded by the provincial Eagle chieftain.  
Shasta was overrun by the forces of Tlazolteotl.
  From Adele:  In early summer, Tlazolteotl rode her flying armies over to 
Mongu.
  From Adele:  In early winter, Tlazolteotl took her men on tactical 
exercises and the 106th Dragons improved in quality.
  In early summer, Alain (#33) flew over to Jadegate.
  Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0) sent an invasion force into the 
Mountain province of Jadegate, owned by Agesilao (#9).  Alain (#33) was in 
command of the invading armies.  The defenders were commanded by Agesilao 
(#9).  Although Agesilao's forces were triumphant, Alain (#33) regrouped his 
men and prepared to contest Jadegate.

  In late summer, in Jadegate, Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0) 
campaigned against Agesilao (#9).  Alain (#33) commanded the attacking 
armies.  The defending forces were led by Agesilao (#9).  Jadegate was 
overrun by the forces of Alain (#33).

  In early winter, a conquering horde owing their allegiance to Agesilao 
(#9) invaded the province of Katmai, a Forest area ruled by 
Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0).  Agesilao (#9) commanded the invading 
armies.  The defenders were commanded by Alain (#33).  The defenders 
defeated Agesilao (#9)'s forces and drove them out of Katmai.
  In fall, Bagmore (#75) rode into Abu Matariq.
  In early summer, Astelle (#82) travelled to Kiska.  During her travels 
this season, Astelle was badgered by a boorish rogue who ridiculed the proud 
Kingdom of the King.  Astelle slew him in a duel, but the rogue's best 
friend was a marshal, and he came after Astelle!  Astelle ran shamelessly 
and fled from the combat.
  In fall, Astelle travelled to Abu Matariq.  Astelle also found an Ancient 
Megaliths in Abu Matariq, inhabited by the Renegade Necromancer.  During her 
travels, Astelle was badgered by a rogue who insulted the respected Kingdom 
of the King.  Astelle killed him in a duel, but the rogue's older brother 
was a colonel, and he came after Astelle!
  In fall, Brunhilda (#86) rode into Abu Matariq.  Brunhilda discovered an 
interesting feature in Abu Matariq: a Tower inhabited by the Witch.


Kingdom of Uga-Buga Makumb (#1):
  In fall, Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll (#1)'s minions initiated a 
campaign of conquest directed at Marzuq, a Desert province owing its 
allegiance to Prometeo (#5).  Pascal (#78)'s forces took Marzuq without any 
major engagements.
  In fall, Kari (#81) journeyed to Orielle.


Kingdom of Prometeo (#5):
  In spring, Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0)'s minions initiated a 
campaign of conquest directed at Shasta, a Mountain province owing 
allegiance to Prometeo (#5).  Tlazolteotl (#88) was in command of the 
attacking armies.  The defending forces were commanded by the provincial 
Eagle chieftain.  Shasta was overrun by the forces of Tlazolteotl.

  In fall, Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll (#1)'s minions initiated a 
campaign of conquest directed at Marzuq, a Desert province owing its 
allegiance to Prometeo (#5).  Pascal (#78)'s forces took Marzuq without any 
major engagements.

Kingdom of Agesilao (#9):
  In early summer, Agesilao (#9) marched into Jadegate from Bizerte to 
defend Jadegate against its would-be conquerors.
  Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0) sent an invasion force into the 
Mountain province of Jadegate, owned by Agesilao (#9).  Alain (#33) was in 
command of the invading armies.  The defenders were commanded by Agesilao 
(#9).  Although Agesilao's forces were triumphant, Alain (#33) regrouped his 
men and prepared to contest Jadegate.

  In late summer, in Jadegate, Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0) 
campaigned against Agesilao (#9).  Alain (#33) commanded the attacking 
armies.  The defending forces were led by Agesilao (#9).  Jadegate was 
overrun by the forces of Alain (#33).

  In early winter, a conquering horde owing their allegiance to Agesilao 
(#9) invaded the province of Katmai, a Forest area ruled by 
Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0).  Agesilao (#9) commanded the invading 
armies.  The defenders were commanded by Alain (#33).  The defenders 
defeated Agesilao (#9)'s forces and drove them out of Katmai.
  In early summer, Negumba (#98) rode his flying armies over to Jadegate.


END MOVES REPORT

  Congratulations!  Your kingdom has reached level 5 in Sageness.  At levels 5
and up, there is not necessarily an increase in the chance to invent 
something.  Instead, the Sage attracts a company of philosphers and builds a 
University in his province of birth.  All characters of this high level gain 
a new Advanced Ability: 
  SAGE'S UNIVERSITY:  The Sage gains an additional plus 1 level when 
researching inventions if he is at his University (the location is shown in 
the Characters listing).  All percentage bonuses are cumulative.


